	DCA T1		/SAVE NEXT ADDRESS
	TAD THISLN	/COMPARE LINE POSITIONS
	CIA CLL
	TAD T1
	SZL CLA 	/SKIP IF THISLN > X
	TAD CNTR	/CHANGE (X) TO ACCOUNT FOR
	TAD T1		/GARBAGE COLLECTION.
	DCA I T2
	TAD T1		/GET NEXT
	JMP DOK
