ACMINS,	0	/ROUTINE TO COMPLEMENT FLAC - VIA "MINSKI"
	CLA 		/********(IS THIS CLA NECESSARY?)
	TAD OVER2	/******** RECODING FOR SPACE
	CLL CML CIA	/********
